# the lowering of copies into the target's moves, see doc/machine/copy.md
#
# after the frame every copy and parallel copy becomes the moves the set
# states for its pairs of locations, ordered so no value is overwritten
# before it is read, a cycle broken through a location liveness shows free or
# the set's swap. the set states its moves as data, so this names no
# instruction.

